    "title": "Miroshnik commented on the expansion of laws in Ukraine",
    "text": "Ambassador for special guidelines of the Russian Foreign Ministry on crimes of the Kyiv Rodion Miroshnik regime commented on the expansion of law in Ukraine. He talked about this written in its telegram channel.\nAccording to Miroshnik, the expansion of laws in Ukraine, diagonally holding the presidential election in this country in the near future. In addition, the Ambassador also stated that this initiative Kyiv showed his attitude towards the peaceful initiatives of US President Donald Trump, Miroshnik believed that the Ukrainian government expanded the law because they did not have plans to agree to end.\nThe expansion of the Kyiv Army Law puts the cross in the opportunity to organize elections before the end of this year. Certrizbirk Ukraine has recently stated that at least six months to prepare and organize the election.\nEarlier, Ukraine's Vernkhovna Rada expanded the operation of the Domestic Army Law and mobilized the country until August.",
